1
00:00:00,515 --> 00:00:04,015
that I've made 14 of these
and you've made three.

2
00:00:04,019 --> 00:00:06,049
(knocking)

3
00:00:06,955 --> 00:00:09,425
(Raj:)Hey. Where are the guys?

4
00:00:09,424 --> 00:00:10,824
(Penny:)Oh, they went to the store
to get solder,

5
00:00:10,826 --> 00:00:14,426
(Penny:)which is metal you melt
to make science things.

6
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:16,930
(Bernadette:)Since when
do you work on weekends?

7
00:00:16,932 --> 00:00:18,432
(Raj:)I'm an astrophysicist.

8
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:20,703
(Raj:)The stars don't take a day off.

9
00:00:20,702 --> 00:00:23,502
(Penny:)You were home alone
and had no one to play with?

10
00:00:23,505 --> 00:00:26,775
(Raj:)Well, the cleaning lady was
there, but she doesn't like me.

11
00:00:27,943 --> 00:00:29,313
(Raj:)You need any help?

12
00:00:29,311 --> 00:00:31,941
(Bernadette:)Not with
Lightning McQueen here.

13
00:00:31,947 --> 00:00:33,677
(Penny:)I think we're good.

14
00:00:33,682 --> 00:00:35,252
(Raj:)Okay. That's cool.

15
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:37,580
(Raj:)I guess everybody's involved
in this project but me.

16
00:00:37,586 --> 00:00:40,356
(Raj:)So... see ya.

17
00:00:40,355 --> 00:00:43,025
(door shuts)

18
00:00:43,025 --> 00:00:44,055
(Bernadette:)I feel bad.

19
00:00:44,059 --> 00:00:45,129
(Bernadette:)Should we have asked him
to stay?

20
00:00:45,127 --> 00:00:47,297
KOOTHRAPPALI (high-pitched):
Yes.

21
00:00:50,465 --> 00:00:52,865
(Amy:)Will you please tell me
where we're going?

22
00:00:52,868 --> 00:00:56,538
(Sheldon:)Sorry, you're on
a need-to-know basis.

23
00:00:57,472 --> 00:00:58,772
(Amy:)I'm driving the car.

24
00:00:58,774 --> 00:01:01,144
(Amy:)I need to know.

